  "text": "Here is the simple rule to decide between Google Sheets and Airtable. Founders overcomplicate their tech stack by forcing complex relational workflows into basic grid spreadsheets. Use Google Sheets when you need heavy financial formulas, numerical forecasting, or raw data crunching. Switch to Airtable the moment you manage linked records, client portals, or multi-stage project pipelines. This decision protects your operational momentum.",
